agement1">Chief Credit Officer</in-capmkt:DesignationOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:SalutationOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Mr.</in-capmkt:SalutationOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement1">Nitin Rughwani</in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement1">2026-09-23</in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange><in-capmkt:BriefProfile contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Mr. Nitin is a Seasoned credit and risk leader with over two decades of experience driving scalable lending operations, digital credit transformation, and strategic portfolio growth across leading NBFCs and private banks. Proven expertise in launching and managing high-yield retail and secured lending verticals, building high-performance credit teams, and implementing AI/ML led decision-making frameworks to enhance risk intelligence and reduce turnaround times. Recognized for consistently delivering portfolio profitability, regulatory compliance, and market expansion through data-driven governance, operational excellence, and innovation in credit infrastructure. 

He has held senior leadership positions at Shriram Finance Limited, Yes Bank Limited and Tata Capital Limited with extensive experience in credit underwriting, risk management, portfolio growth and lending business transformation. 

